        </li>
        <li class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          <strong class="text-ink">"How do I stop regressions in a pipeline?"</strong>
          {' '}Require CI/CD support — a tool you can run on every deploy and fail a build below a threshold.
        </li>
        <li class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
